      "sourceTextSha256": "d6ce865ad1304ab493ba32d15d04978ec82e53e961334eaea3528350495ef207",
      "text": "Day 1 · Arrival at Rio de Janeiro Airport, where a driver awaits you with a sign bearing our logo and your names. Transfer to the hotel past green hills, rocky peaks, palm trees and beautiful bays. In the evening, stroll along the famous black-and-white mosaic promenades of Copacabana and Ipanema, with cafés open late and cold coconut water by the sea.",
