    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "9d11ac4459f3c8a00d0520f89d60fcf7cd46bd06e35544cb9e7d0f780d49726b",
      "text": "Day 2 · Breakfast, then a half-day excursion (4 hours) with an English-speaking guide. From Praia Vermelha, a cable car takes you up to Morro da Urca, with its wide observation deck, restaurants and bars, then on to Sugar Loaf, with views of Copacabana, Ipanema, Leme, Guanabara Bay, the Rio–Niterói Bridge, Niterói and its Niemeyer architecture, and Christ the Redeemer on Corcovado. Continue by car to old Rio, with its churches, monasteries and colonial buildings and, time permitting, the Metropolitan Cathedral and the Selarón Steps.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1ck8kmnOfAWP51X7AI_Izny4uRB-G2Nsz",
